                "source": "TweetDeck",
                "text": "After recent disasters, we\u2019ve witnessed insurers abandon the state and terminate policies. This has left Louisiana families with limited insurance options, driving up costs and destroying financial security for scores of thousands of Louisiana citizens.\n\nhttps://t.co/XYgAgdK6Q6",
