                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "TweetDeck",
                "text": "My bill reforms existing tax code, restructuring the tax burden to encourage insurance availability for LA. Further, because insurance is largely regulated at the state level, I am hopeful that our bill can serve as a model for similar legislation in the LA State Legislature.",
